'''Fenrings''' are aggressive [[creatures]] found in the [[Mountain|Mountains]] during the night. Their appearance is distinctly werewolf-like, standing on two legs with a black fur coat. Unlike their [[Frost Caves|Frost cave]] [[Ulv|counterparts]], Fenrings only walk on their hind-legs.

