== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Fenrings|Aggressive creature strategies#Fenring}}

=== Claw ===
Swings their claw in a 3-meter 90-degree horizontal arc to scratch the player (85 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] damage). This attack has a 3-second cooldown and can be used within 2.5 meters of the player. This also has a second variation where, despite the attack name, Fenrings lunge forward and bite the player; besides the animation, it's completely identical<ref>Aside from visuals, the animations also have very minor differences in their properties. The claw swing animation is 1.37 seconds long and hits after 0.65 seconds, while the bite animation is 1.53 seconds long and hits after 0.71 seconds. This is a hitbox time differential of 0.06 seconds; for reference, the parry window is 0.25 seconds.</ref> to the other variant and both share a single cooldown.

=== Jump ===
Pounces on the player and swings in with both claws (95 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] damage). This hits in a 3-meter 90-degree horizontal arc. This attack can be used every 8 seconds when within 5–9 meters of a player, meaning it's disabled while standing close to Fenrings.

