==Notes==
*The name "Fenring" is derived from [[wikipedia:Fenrir|Fenrir]], the same way [[Surtling|Surtlings]] derive from Surt. Fenrir (sometimes spelled Fenris or Fenrisulfr, "the Fenrir/Fenris-wolf") is a giant Wolf from Norse and Germanic mythology who will swallow the god Odin during Ragnarökr. He is the son of Loki.

